    claimed-ticket leases, decoupled from any `wq claim` call. cmd_claim's own
    reclaim-on-claim housekeeping (search "wq#530: a reclaim is never silent again"
    above) only ever runs against the ONE lane being claimed, as a side effect of
    somebody else wanting work in it — a lane nobody happens to claim from can sit on
