    hours-long dangles, only cleared when the orchestrator eventually retired them by
    hand). `wq reap` sweeps every lane (or one, with --lane) in a single pass and
    reverts each expired claim the exact same way cmd_claim's housekeeping does —
    status back to open, lease cleared, expired slocks dropped — then prints one
